00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:34.660
"Fanservice" is a term derived from
the anime and manga fandom itself

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:37.540
to describe material that is intentionally added to a series or show

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:40.740
with the purpose of catering towards a certain group of people or fans

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.330
and giving them exactly what they want.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.700
