00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:48.870
since basically anything can technically be defined as fanservice -

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.700
which could range from anything to a shot of the character's panties,

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.460
making the art style emphasize cute, ditsy girls,

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:57.580
or even the inclusion of a little sister character because, in the end,

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:01.650
it all boils down to a concept of, well, servicing the fans.

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:06.030
Nowadays, though, "fanservice" is normally a
phrase used by anime fans - myself included -

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:09.570
to describe the gratuitous depiction of
female characters in a sexualized manner,

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:12.650
which normally equates to the unnecessary
exposure of female body parts

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:17.070
